1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
One mission can involve several coding agents.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,500
Pytxo plans who owns each path, maps dependencies,

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:13,000
and starts work in isolated workspaces.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Before anything reaches your repository,
Run Review shows the base revision, execution plan,

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,500
permission profile, enforcement evidence,

6
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:27,000
and every addition, edit, and deletion
prepared for Apply.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Reviewed Apply is limited to Orbit and Galaxy,
inside one execution domain and one repository root.

8
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Approve once, and Pytxo applies
that reviewed change set

9
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
as one crash-recoverable operation.

10
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:43,000
If the checkout moves, Pytxo stops
and asks you to review again.

11
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Operations shows the decision,
ownership, and outcome,

12
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,500
not a wall of terminal noise.

13
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:52,000
Keep the agents you already use. Add Pytxo.
